\ A wrong proof for S2's tactics (tests/front/check_s2.py; its Lean twin is
\ tests/front/s2-wrong.lean's w_induction_plain): by-induction without
\ alternatives leaves both cases open (error 89, Lean's unsolved goals).
theorem w_induction_plain
  Nat explicit: n
  0 n + n =
:= by
  n by-induction
end w_induction_plain
